R:Demonstrate recursive module use
R:Modules are ATARI PILOT's name for subroutines (SPEC 8.3)
R:J: is conditional like any other statement (spec 6.1.7), so the recursion
R:stops when the condition fails and falls through to the E: below.
C:#D=0
U:*COUNT
T:COMPLETED AT DEPTH #D.
E:

*COUNT
C:#D=#D+1
T(#D<3):GOING DEEPER...
T(#D>=3):BOTTOM REACHED.
J(#D<3):*COUNT
E:
